   "source": [
    "# Feature Selection — Heart Disease Prediction\n",
    "\n",
    "Code excerpt from a collaborative Data Mining project. The three methods compare selected features using the preprocessed `df_filtered` dataset from the original notebook. This excerpt is not standalone.\n",
    "\n",
    "[Original team project](https://github.com/JoudySaleh-IT/PredictingHeartDisease)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Filter method — SelectKBest (ANOVA F-test)**\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "X = df_filtered.iloc[:, :-1]\n",
    "y = df_filtered.iloc[:, -1]\n",
    "\n",
    "selector = SelectKBest(score_func=f_classif, k=2)\n",
    "X_new = selector.fit_transform(X, y)\n",
    "\n",
    "selected_features = X.columns[selector.get_support()]\n",
    "print(\"Selected Features:\", selected_features)"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "id": "3t3YZ5QX-qRm",
    "outputId": "16fb6e68-47ef-4e7a-ad5b-32de09585a51",
    "colab": {
     "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
    }
   },
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "stream",
     "name": "stdout",
     "text": [
      "Selected Features: Index(['exang', 'oldpeak'], dtype='object')\n"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Wrapper method — Recursive Feature Elimination (RFE)**\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "X = df_filtered.iloc[:, :-1]\n",
    "y = df_filtered.iloc[:, -1]\n",
    "\n",
    "model = LogisticRegression()\n",
    "\n",
    "rfe = RFE(model, n_features_to_select=2)\n",
    "X_new = rfe.fit_transform(X, y)\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "selected_features = [i for i, mask in enumerate(rfe.support_) if mask]\n",
    "print(\"Selected Features:\", selected_features)\n"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "id": "2rB_rmIk_CGY",
    "outputId": "e6c1fa4a-b8ff-450a-a796-11f1b5e5c1c0",
    "colab": {
